# DO commit the probe traces the pipeline replays (overrides the global *.trace ignore above;
# last-matching rule wins): the deployment model's decision probes AND the full confirmed set
# (probes_full/) so the matrix/tree are rebuildable from the repo without the raw experiments/.
!evaluation-ddyf/fingerprinting/reference/*/probes/*.trace
!evaluation-ddyf/fingerprinting/reference/*/probes_full/*.trace
